From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 19:48:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] wayland: Add ext-idle-notify-v1 support

Implement ext_idle_notifier_v1 on top of the core idle monitor.
Notifications from get_idle_notification follow idle inhibitors like
the session's own idle handling, while those from
get_input_idle_notification, added in version 2, ignore them through an
uninhibitable idle watch.

Apps that lock themselves or remind people to take a break after a
while without input, such as password managers, have no other way to
learn the idle time from inside a sandbox, where the IdleMonitor D-Bus
API isn't reachable by default.

Timeouts shorter than a second are raised to a second, so the protocol
can't be used to time individual key presses.
